WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.800
the way i create a thriving environment here&nbsp;
at Filtrous it's just about letting people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:14.560
be their own boss not micromanage and feel&nbsp;
this is like almost second home to them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:20.960
you can come in here and pretty much share your&nbsp;
ideas share your thoughts have your opinions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:27.120
speak them freely they're always welcome we make&nbsp;
it what we want to make it and we want to preserve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:34.240
that because you want to have this happy upbeat&nbsp;
space sometimes it's very difficult to have that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:40.400
day in day out all day eight hours a day um you&nbsp;
know we have personal stuff going on or you have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:46.240
work stuff going on and and i think one of the&nbsp;
ways that i tell or i share with my colleagues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:53.680
is imagine a tree right outside the door&nbsp;
and you're having like a bad day you know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.680 --> 00:01:00.640
whatever it is and you just hang your [ __ ]&nbsp;
on the tree before you walk through the door&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:06.720
just like to envision that and just like leave&nbsp;
your dirty laundry just hanging outside the doors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:14.640
and when you are happy or you're smiling or just&nbsp;
like thinking about good thoughts it comes across&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:20.240
as well for me i try to always have background&nbsp;
music playing on my radio on my desk because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:27.040
that to me that's my happy or i'll write smile&nbsp;
on my paper on my desk every day i write smile&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:32.000
and i put a happy face so if something happens&nbsp;
i'll look down and i'm like okay i'll smile&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.480
and those are things you know it's just creating&nbsp;
little things that are gonna help you stay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:42.240
cheerful throughout your day for me what makes&nbsp;
filtrus different than everywhere that i've worked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:52.720
is obviously david his support with all his&nbsp;
employees he literally wants everybody that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:59.600
walks through that door be successful and he&nbsp;
genuinely feels that in his heart and you can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:06.000
see that come across and to me that's somebody&nbsp;
who's very passionate very caring and that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.840
very different than any other place that&nbsp;
I've ever worked i feel like i have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:15.920
in corporate America most of my life you're just&nbsp;
pretty much a number it's really hard to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:24.000
that personal one-on-one feel from the owner let&nbsp;
alone the CEO for me it's gonna sound super cliche&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:31.840
but it has turned my whole life around and this is&nbsp;
the best way to describe it i feel like i had been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:37.200
walking around life with my eyes closed this place&nbsp;
kind of opened my eyes to this whole new world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:41.920
before i came to work for Filtrous it was&nbsp;
you know basically you go to work you do the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:47.840
routine job you go home at the end of the day&nbsp;
not until did i come here did he really push me&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:56.320
to really start thinking and focusing on my own&nbsp;
personal growth it's just been like literally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:02.640
life-changing we all have goals we all have things&nbsp;
that need to get done on the daily in order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:08.800
keep moving the business forward but doesn't&nbsp;
mean that you can't enjoy your day while you're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:15.600
accomplishing your goals i help people have a&nbsp;
voice by pulling them aside and allowing them to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:22.320
feel like they can express the negative along&nbsp;
with the positive if they have something that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:26.800
didn't sit well with them i try to let them&nbsp;
know you can come to me or you can go to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:32.400
anybody else that you feel comfortable enough&nbsp;
with sharing that you would want to work here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:41.280
at Filtrous because it is still a small company&nbsp;
that's getting ready to explode and not only that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:48.560
it's a place that you can come and be part&nbsp;
of something that's gonna be really big I've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:55.920
seen it already and we're not even at scratching&nbsp;
the surface yet to have seen the company go from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:02.160
not only four employees to 20 plus employees now&nbsp;
but seeing that little building that looked like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:08.160
it could have been gone the next day to being&nbsp;
in this building that we now own and seeing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:15.440
growth and the vision that David shared with&nbsp;
me from day one come to life is super exciting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:23.680
my piece of advice to a new employee is the sky's&nbsp;
the limit and really honestly it is the god honest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:29.920
truth that you can make this place what you want&nbsp;
it to be I've seen people go from the warehouse to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:36.400
become senior lab techs I've seen people go from&nbsp;
the warehouse to become sales reps there's no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:43.520
rules here no traditional rules that you have to&nbsp;
have a degree or some kind of background we will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:55.840
give you those opportunities as long as you're&nbsp;
willing to work for them the sky's the limit here

